00:01:08.941 --> 00:01:12.640
Cloud Bigtables are a massively
scalable, NoSQL database,

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:15.410
and it's perfect
for an IoT use case.

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:21.340
So we put sensors like this in
the back of a few Google Street

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:26.560
View cars and are
monitoring air quality live

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:28.780
