00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:31.690
We have a few cars right
on the road driving

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.840
around the San Francisco area.

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:38.080
Let me zoom in a little bit.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:41.380
If we wait a few seconds, we can
actually watch it move around.

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:44.890
The data is streaming
in here through Pub/Sub.

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:46.750
We've got a 4G
connector on here.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:50.560
It sends messages to Pub/Sub,
processes it with Dataflow,

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:53.170
and then write to Bigtable.

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:58.820
We also had a collection of
three years of historical data.

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:01.480
So we visualize that
as well and created

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:03.310
