dashboard with this.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:09.009
Bigtable is perfect for
serving an application,

00:02:09.009 --> 00:02:11.860
because you get really fast
writes and really fast reads.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:18.270
So here we're able to look at
the past three years of data.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:19.060
Let me see.

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:20.840
