too many data points on there.

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:57.570
And also Bigtable, we have
the really fast reads,

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:01.350
so we're able to do training
directly on our data--

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:03.570
on our data in Bigtable.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:08.160
We don't move our data to GCS or
another, kind of, fast storage

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:09.750
system.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.630
So we're doing nitrogen
dioxide predictions

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:16.080
based on zip code and date.

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.712
So we can click
somewhere on the map

00:03:17.712 --> 00:03:19.920
