the nitrogen dioxide values.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.230
And yeah, we can
also change the date.

00:03:29.721 --> 00:03:34.820
In August or something,
you can see if it changes.

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:37.900
It's not-- we didn't do a
great job training the model.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.150
We're really just trying to
show the proof of concept.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:43.260
The Bigtable is great
for IoT workflow,

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:46.140
great for doing machine
learning on top of.

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:48.480
Here is some of the
architecture we've got going on.

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.120
Let me see--

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.015
Present.

00:03:51.015 --> 00:03:54.420
So yeah, we've got this beacon
streams to Pub/Sub, to data

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.390
flow, and then Bigtable.

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:58.860
And for the batch
data, we can just

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:01.440
