00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:08.550
For the machine learning, we
trained our TensorFlow model

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:12.000
on Compute Engine, and then
we host that with the Cloud

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.088
Machine Learning Services.

00:04:14.088 --> 00:04:15.630
And on the front
end, we're accessing

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:18.065
that with a Cloud Function.

00:04:18.065 --> 00:04:19.440
And this is all
just being hosted

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:25.880
